ex4h/ex1h = DIRECTION-SIGNED market excess: sgn × (fwd − market_mean), sgn=+1 LONG/−1 SHORT.
p = Wilcoxon signed-rank of excess vs 0 (edge test).
solo = episodes where NO other gate fired on same token+direction within ±10min (marginal value).
mfe>2% = share of blocked episodes that printed ≥+2% favorable excursion in 4h (killed winners).
VERDICT KEY (auditor-aligned): NO EDGE = |ex-mean| ≤ 0.2% AND p > Bonferroni threshold
  (gate blocks market-average signals = noise filter; nominal p<0.05 alone is NOT a verdict).
  WORKS = ex-mean < −0.2% AND p < threshold. BLOCKS WINNERS = ex-mean > +0.2% AND p < threshold.

